#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The only part of the game that can be changed is the color of the stones. To "
"change the color of the stones use <menuchoice> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Use Colored Chips</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:457
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have made a mistake. Can I undo?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:458
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To undo your last move you can use <menuchoice><shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Move</guimenu><guimenuitem>Undo</guimenuitem></menuchoice> on the "
"menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:463
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use keyboard?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:464
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kappname; does not provide for the keyboard play."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:467
#, no-c-format
msgid "I cannot figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:468
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To activate the &kappname; hint system use "
"<menuchoice><shortcut><keycap>H</keycap></shortcut><guimenu>Move</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Hint</guimenuitem></menuchoice> on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:471
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:472
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kappname; does not have a save feature."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:475
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where are the high scores?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:476
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To access &kappname; highs core board use <menuchoice><shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut><guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show High Scores...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:480
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the game configuration. Where do I go?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:481
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All of the possible &kappname;'s settings are located under the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu></menuchoice> on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:484
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the toolbar layout. What do I do?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:485
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To change the toolbar layout please use <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Toolbars...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> on the "
"menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:492
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:494
#, no-c-format
msgid "Multiplayer Support"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:496
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; can be played online on any GGZ Gaming Zone site. You can find "
"other players there, and compete against them. Just enter one of the "
"available Reversi rooms with any GGZ core client, such as kggz, and "
"&kappname; will be offered to you as your favourite game client. If a GGZ "
"core client is installed, you can try out GGZ by visiting the <ulink url="
"\"ggz://live.ggzgamingzone.org/#Reversi\">community site</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:505
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Remember that when playing online, the opponent might be either a human "
"player or a computer player. The latter one might behave differently from "
"the computer player included in &kappname;."
msgstr ""

